   "id": 1,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 3
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Expected metrics** (prometheus_client naming): `ingest_rows_total{table}` counter, `ingest_batches_total{status}` counter, `ingest_errors_total{type}` counter, `ingest_batch_duration_seconds` histogram, `ingest_rows_inflight` gauge, `ingest_last_success_timestamp_seconds` gauge, `ingest_queue_depth` gauge, `ingest_batch_size_rows` histogram, `ingest_retries_total` counter. Panels stay empty until the engine serves /metrics on port 8000 (targets/*/ingestion-engine.yml)."
   }
  },
